### Login first — see http/api.http

### List jobs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/infra/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inbox
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/infra/inbox
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Data change logs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/infra/data-changes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Files (list)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/infra/files
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
